window.products.push({"id":742011,"name":"Eating Solicitors Sign - 10x7 - Raised Bronze Metal Coated Plaque","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ldg1IbFVL._AC_.jpg","description":"Solicitors and Trespassers Beware and Be Warned. You \"will be killed and eaten\". All in Good Fun (we think). Have a good laugh with our Naughty No Soliciting Signs and No Trespassing Signs. Make it the law, hang the skull and crossbones on your gate or the door to the Man Cave. Signs ship three weeks from payment date as they are custom signs made to order by crafts people in the USA.   Our Signs and Plaques have a base of modern 30 pound High Density Urethane (HDU) board (a type of plastic). This is a product that was developed for the aerospace industry and has been used for signage for over 40 years. It's light weight, waterproof, and will last decades in an exterior environment.   We coat our HDU with a cold applied real metal coating that is in use world-wide as an architectural and industrial coating. It is a well-proven, tough, and beautiful coating that gives the look of cast metal without the limitations of weight and cost. Therefore, when you receive your order, you will notice that it is light weight. Since it is HDU with a thin metal coating, it's light and easy to hang on any wall without fear of testing the building's structural integrity.   Our signs and plaques receive a marine grade lacquer coating prior to shipment. \"Marine Grade\" means that the coating is designed to protect even in harsh coastal environments. That being said, our metal coatings are a \"living finish\" and you can expect some changes over time even though they are protected with a high-quality protective clear coat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ldg1IbFVL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Atlas Signs and Plaques","source_asin":"B00L1ERFT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L1ERFT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L1ERFT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
