window.products.push({"id":742127,"name":"3 Pcs Break Apart Chocolate Molds Silicone Deep Candy Bar Molds Silicone Shapes, Silicone Molds for Wax Melts Large(Edelweiss set)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YEXgEh3IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PROFESSIONAL DETAIL DESIGN - There are 2 accurate measurement scales on the silicone chocolate molds, 0.6\"for deep bar and 0.4\"for thin bar, meet your different needs. In addition, professional chocolate molds with special design at the bottom keeps the entire product balanced and firm, it's convenient and no need to put a pan underneath the chocolate silicone molds when using. Besides, 5°sloped sides of each thick chocolate bar molds will make your finished chocolate pop out more easily YOUR CHOCOLATE IS SHINING! - With very eye-catching polished Edelweiss shaped cavities and 1.5mm thick walls for good support, our silicone candy bar molds allow you to create shiny and amazing chocolates! It's a nice presentation if you prepare those gorgeous energy bar for gifts, or personalize snap bar wax melts as small business. The large chocolate bar molds set are also great for gift baskets, giving your loved one or friends a sweet unforgettable baking memory DEEP AND EXTRA LARGE - Compared with thin chocolate bar molds of other brand, our chocolate candy molds are 7.7x4.1x0.8 inch while the finished chocolate is 3.1x6.1x0.7 inch, large and deep enough to add a layer of nuts and fruits. Break apart silicone molds for candy bars, chocolate bars, keto fat bombs, butters, caramels and even wax melts, suitable for any festivals and occasions, such as Halloween, Christmas, new year, baby showers, birthday parties, etc. HIGH-QUALITY BAKEWARE - Fimary's flexible chocolate molds silicone set are BPA free, designed stronger, with more durable and thick premium materials that last longer than other break apart candy bar molds. Heat resistant from -40℉ to +446℉, these large silicone bar molds can be allowed for using in the freezer, oven and micro-wave, don't change shape or have odd smell afterwards. If you have any problem with our silicon chocolate candy molds, please contact us CLEANS IN SECONDS AND DISHWASHER SAFE - People always get frustrated by cleaning cheap chocolate bar silicone molds for leftover residue. With non stick surface, our deep silicone bar molds for baking are easy to demold, your chocolates can pop out perfectly with good detailed shape and break apart nicely. After use, just simply put the large chocolate molds silicone set into dishwasher, it comes out like new! If you don't use an automatic machine, cleaning it by hot soapy water is also a breeze","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YEXgEh3IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fimary","source_asin":"B096VZ75GK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096VZ75GK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096VZ75GK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
