window.products.push({"id":742145,"name":"Alfi Juwel 17-Ounce Carafe, Chrome Plated Brass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31lvT3h4kiL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Perfect for entertaining or everyday use, Alfi carafes feature amazing thermal properties and vacuum seals, keeping your beverages fresh, and just the right temperature for many hours. High quality German design, function, and beauty come together in all Alfi's carafes, and many have won numerous design awards. Alfi carafes will be treasured for years to come. From the Manufacturer The world leader in high-quality thermal carafes, Alfi designs and produces products with aesthetic appeal and superior performance. Employing cutting-edge technology, state-of-the art materials, and the craftsmanship of world-renowned designers, Alfi elevates the common carafe to a work of scientific and artistic excellence. In addition, only environmental-friendly technical equipment is used in the manufacture of Alfi products. The Juwel Carafe, a well-loved classic, celebrated its 85th anniversary in 2003. Originally designed in 1918 for the Pullman cars of American railroads, this vacuum jug has adorned the coffee tables of generations. Alfi remained true to the original form, minus a few subtle contemporary adaptations. The Juwel Carafe features the AlfiDur vacuum hardglass liner, a metal handle, and a hinged cover with stopper. The double-walled AlfiDur vacuum hardglass liner keeps hot drinks hot and cold drinks cold. Before assembly each glass liner undergoes an operational test. Other outstanding features include: The hinged lid provides single-hand operation and is food safe. The hinged lid provides single-hand operation and is food safe. The twin-walled AlfiDur toughened hardglass liner creates a vacuum between the walls, allowing neither heat nor cold to escape; 100-percent performance tested. The twin-walled AlfiDur toughened hardglass liner creates a vacuum between the walls, allowing neither heat nor cold to escape; 100-percent performance tested. The seal prevents the escape of radiant heat. The seal prevents the escape of radiant heat. The body of the flask is comprised of high-quality raw materials e.g. copper and brass. Top quality is achieved by hand craftsmanship. The body of the flask is comprised of high-quality raw materials e.g. copper and brass. Top quality is achieved by hand craftsmanship. The seals/screw fittings are food-safe and quality-tested. Each part can be replaced or repaired. The seals/screw fittings are food-safe and quality-tested. Each part can be replaced or repaired.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31lvT3h4kiL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alfi","source_asin":"B0001FZAFO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001FZAFO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001FZAFO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
