window.products.push({"id":742152,"name":"BLACK+DECKER 3-in-1 Waffle Maker with Nonstick Reversible Plates, Stainless Steel, G48TD (Renewed)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e1h+cgQIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This pre-owned or refurbished product has been professionally inspected and tested to work and look like new. How a product becomes part of Amazon Renewed, your destination for pre-owned, refurbished products: A customer buys a new product and returns it or trades it in for a newer or different model. That product is inspected and tested to work and look like new by Amazon-qualified suppliers. Then, the product is sold as an Amazon Renewed product on Amazon. If not satisfied with the purchase, renewed products are eligible for replacement or refund under the Amazon Renewed Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e1h+cgQIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B07QS7T918","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QS7T918","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QS7T918","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":742153,"name":"nambe Yaro Acacia Wood Salad Bowl with 2 Salad Servers | Made of Acacia wood and Nambe Alloy | Large Deep Wooden Bowls | Acacia Wood Salad Bowl Set | ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Ap4SekPEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Bring richness and dimension to the table with this handsome 13-inch-wide salad bowl and accompanying set of servers. Ideal for tossed salads such as arugula, spinach, romaine hearts, and other mixed greens, the smooth bowl also makes an eye-catching way to present pasta dishes, assorted fruit, and other side dishes. Use the servers for gently dishing up even the most delicate ingredients without crushing them. Constructed of dense, durable, naturally resinous acacia wood that won't absorb stains or odors, the attractive bowl sits atop a narrow pedestal base and sports a dramatically flared rim. Its warm coloring features a finely grained pattern in varying shades, with thick walls and eye-catching symmetrical perfection. The two included spoon-like servers come with matching acacia-wood heads and ergonomically sculpted, signature Nambe alloy handles. The set nicely complements Nambe's identically shaped, individual Yaro salad bowls (sold separately in sets of four). All pieces should be hand washed with warm, soapy water for best results.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Ap4SekPEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nambe","source_asin":"B005LQ8M9E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005LQ8M9E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005LQ8M9E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
