window.products.push({"id":742199,"name":"Kilner Store Jar Set, 34-Fluid Ounce Glass Canister with Collapsible Silicone Measuring Cups, Space-Saving & Convenient Design, Airtight Clip Top Lid ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q+HTvXQ6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Kilner Measure and Store Jar Set provides an innovative solution to saving space in the kitchenThe Kilner Measure and Store Jar Set offers a new way to measure and store your cooking and baking essentials. The Kilner Clip Top jar is designed for home canning, bottling and storing dry food such as sugar, flour, rice, lentils and more. Made from high-quality durable glass, the canister features a stainless steel clip top and airtight rubber seal to ensure lasting freshness. Uniquely designed to fit into the Kilner Clip Top Jar lid and neck, 2 easy-to-use silicone measuring cups come in handy for baking, cooking and scooping contents from jar and collapse when not in use. Embossed markings on cups make measuring with precision simple. Set includes 1 Kilner Clip Top Jar with a capacity of 34-fluid ounces, 1 yellow 1/4 measuring cup and 1 blue 1/2 measuring cup. Canister measures 8-1/2\" high x 6\" wide x 6\" deep. Glass canister (without seal) and silicone measuring cups are dishwasher safe. Remove rubber seal from jar prior to putting in dishwasher and hand wash only. Imported.The Kilner business was first established by John Kilner in the 1840's in England. Initially producing glass bottles and jars, it was towards the end of the 19th century when the original Kilner Jar was first invented. The original Kilner jar is as much-loved and successful now as it was 120 years ago. Its long-lasting popularity is owed to its distinctive pressure seal and iconic design. Put simply, households all over the world trust it to successfully preserve and pickle their fruit and vegetables. Now, not only is the Kilner jar an essential for the kitchen but has become a statement of style around the home and office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q+HTvXQ6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kilner","source_asin":"B078WYQVT9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078WYQVT9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078WYQVT9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
