window.products.push({"id":742329,"name":"BaseAire AirWerx55 Dehumidifier for Crawl Space Basement,120 Pints Commercial Dehumidifier with Continuous Drain Hose, 5 Years Warranty, Intelligent H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":648.66,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616IMGD4zrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1. [120 Pints Dehumidifier ] Removing up to 55 pints of water per day (under 60%RH @ 80°F condition), 120 PDD at saturation,this energy-efficient dehumidifier is ideal to dehumidify damp space up to 1,300 sq ft. Perfect for home, basement, crawlspace, laundry room, garages, store room,large room, factories, and commercial use, you can maintain a healthy 45%-55% humidity range easily! 2.[ Easy-to-use Dehumidifier ] Plug it in, set the target humidity, this smart dehumidifier will AUTO-STOP when the set humidity level has been met and AUTO RESTART when the room humidity raises up again or even after a power interruption. This dehumidifier with a drain hose (6.5-ft) allows you to simply attach the hose to achieve self-draining by gravity. 3.[ Auto-Defrost & Memory Restare Function ] Auto defrost function eliminates maintenance and allows this durable room dehumidifier to use in a cold environment low to 33.8°F. This basement dehumidifier is also designed to restart in the event of a power interruption. 4.[ Portable Design & Compact Size ] Dehumidifier ideal for Crawl Space & Basement Use, dehumidifier with the compact size and a strong handle, this portable dehumidifier is easy to carry from room to room. With a peak noise level at 52 dB(A), you can be worry-free to have this quiet dehumidifier running whenever and wherever you need it. Optional Remote control, It is also a good choice for sound insulation and saving space usage. (Needs to be purchased separately) 5.[ Quality Support & Good Service ] All BaseAire Dehumidifiers are covered with a 5 Year Warranty and lifetime expert tech support. If there is any question, please don't hesitate to contact us, we will reply to you within 24 hours and help you solve the problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616IMGD4zrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BASEAIRE DRY YOUR CRAWL SPACE & BASEMENT","source_asin":"B0C7KD1G4G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7KD1G4G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7KD1G4G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
