window.products.push({"id":742342,"name":"Lifewit Shower Caddy, Rustproof Stainless Steel Shower Organizer, No Drilling Traceless Adhesive Shower Shelves For Bathroom & Kitchen Storage, 2-Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718vhqhY9SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Load Capacity Up to 40LBS: Our adhesive strips are strong and water-resistant, and is able to stick on most smooth surfaces, including glass, tile, wall, etc. Each shower storage caddy can easily hold up to 40lbs of shower supplies so no need to worry about falling down because it is strong enough to stay on the wall. 2-Pack Ample Storage Capacity: Two pack set, with dimensions 30.4 X 9 X 5.8cm (11.95\" X 3.54\" X 2.28\"), and 28.9 X 9 X 5.2cm (11.36\" X 3.54\" X 2.05\"). Each bathroom caddy has 4 fixed hooks, can be used to hang razors, towels, bath balls, etc. It can be installed in the bathroom, next to the sink, kitchen and pantry to keep the space tidy. Durable Material: The shower rack is made of rust-proof stainless steel material, and adds a corrosion-resistant coating to the surface. It has passed the 72-hour salt spray test, which makes it non-fading and scratch-resistant improving the service life of the shower caddy. Easy Installation: Forget about holes, screws, and nails. Just stick the adhesive strips, hang the bathroom shower organizer and it is installed in minutes. Ideal for rental homes and walls that cannot be drilled. When you need to remove the bathroom caddy, simply heat the strip with a hair dryer and it will come off easily. Space Saving Design: This shower caddy is able to get your items well organized, and you can customize the height of the installation according to your needs. Save space in your bathroom or kitchen, and make your home more tidy. The bottom drainage design makes items dry quickly and keeps them clean. Great for home use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718vhqhY9SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lifewit","source_asin":"B0B5W948H9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5W948H9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5W948H9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
