window.products.push({"id":742369,"name":"Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, 200PCS Non-stick Paper for Air Fryer Oil-proof, Water-proof, Natural Food Grade Parchment Paper for Baking Roasting ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.7,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BuxjYTZPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️KEEP YOUR AIR FRYER CLEAN: airfryer parchment paper prevents the food from sticking to the fryers and it can keep food residue away from the fryer, leaving it clean, unused which results in saving time and energy and can increase life of your air fryer. After usage, air fryer disposable paper liner can easily be thrown away without any need of cleaning the fryer after baking. ✔️EASY TO USE: These parchment paper for air fryer are in a circular bowled shape and does not need to be folded, bent or torn. Simply you can put these disposable paper liners in your air fryer when you are ready to cook. The size of these disposable liners is 6.3 inches which is good enough to cook fish and fries together at one time. There is plenty of time to make 3 or 4 portions to cook at same time. ✔️NON-STICK, WATER-OIL PROOF, CONVENIENT: Disposable air fryer paper liners have a food-grade silicone coating which makes them waterproof and oil-resistant and the food neither stick to the surface of the liners nor on the sides of fryer. Like silicone, these parchment paper for air fryer does not insulate hot air, puts no effect on the taste of the food and can withstand temperatures up to 428 degrees Fahrenheit. Also, they are very convenient and easy to use. ✔️USED WIDELY: The baking paper for Air fryer are suitable for microwave, oven, cooker, steamer, air fryer etc. These parchment paper liners for air fryer can be applied to roasting, baking, frying and for serving food. They are suitable for camping, home baking, BBQ, summer party, and so on. ✔️HEALTHY & RELIABLE:These unbleached air fryer round parchment paper liners are made of raw wood and is free from harmful substances, no fluorescent agent, BPA-free, PFAs-free, making your baking safe, non-toxic and free from food mess.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BuxjYTZPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEVV1","source_asin":"B09XRH2T68","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742369","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XRH2T68","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XRH2T68","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
