window.products.push({"id":742422,"name":"Springform Pan Set of 3 (4\", 7\", 9\") - Non-Stick Leakproof Baking Set - Cake, Cheesecake, Round Cake, Quiche Springform Pans with Spatula, Icing Smoot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MGtXhQ1cS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Springform Pans are the perfect kitchen tool or gift for bakers at any experience level.  They can be used to make cakes, cheesecakes, pies, pizza, quiche, and more, and will help you bake to perfection every time.  Makes a perfect Mother’s Day gift. Our Springform Pan Set includes 3 different sizes and includes 3 additional components: 4-inch Springform Pan7-inch Springform Pan9-inch Springform Pan1 Icing Spatula1 Icing Smoother60 pieces Parchment Paper (20 each pan size) High Quality, Safe & Non-Toxic Our springform pans are PFOA, PFTE, and BPA free. They are designed for effortless food release and clean-up, and made with a double layer nonstick coating and heavy-gauge steel core that helps heat food evenly. Both Oven and Pressure Cooker / Instant Pot Compatible Our Springform Pans also fit both the 6-quart and 8-quart Pressure Cooker / Instant Pot, and are oven safe to 450 degrees Fahrenheit. Cleaning and Other Tips Our Springform Pans are dishwasher safe; however, for best results, we recommend hand washing them with warm, soapy water after use.  Rinse and dry thoroughly with a soft cloth to keep from rusting. Make sure the bottom of each pan is secure in it's slot with textured side up before use. Springform pans are not intended to be completely watertight.  Thin liquids can leak out of the bottom. Wise Life Co. is a US-based company that prides itself in offering high quality products that bring joy to our customers and make their lives easier!  We hope you enjoy our Springform Pan Set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MGtXhQ1cS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wise Life","source_asin":"B08FYS77WG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742422","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FYS77WG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FYS77WG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
