window.products.push({"id":742524,"name":"Aobosi Slow Masticating Juicer 83mm(3.15inch) Wide Chute Juice Extractor Cold Press Juicer Machine with Quiet Motor/Reverse Function/Juice Jug and Cle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LhJWdmzwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔🍇🎀Best Gift!🎀 DOUBLE FEEDER CHUTES(83MM+38MM) : With extra wide 3.15 inch(83MM) BIG MOUTH can easily accommodate large ingredients (Apple, Orange, Pear, etc). Greatly reduces preparation and cleanup time. Less chopping of the ingredients also helps to reduce oxidation. Also equipped with 38MM small mouth which is suitable for the vegetables and small ingredients(Celery, Carrot, etc) . Please cut the celery into small pieces that can prevent getting stuck broken or hard to disassembly. ✔🍅HIGHEST NUTIRTIONAL VALUE WITH LOW SPEED MOTOR : Slow masticating can perfectly separate juice and pulp,extracting higher-purity juice and preserving higher nutritional value. Our auger spins at 47-60 RPM (the best slow speed in the market now: UP TO 90% JUICE YIELD) that can preserves the vitamins, enzymes, minerals, trace minerals and nutrients from being destroyed than centrifugal juicers. Please use the fresh or watery ingredients that can ensure the juice yield as for your expectation. ✔🍒CONVENIENT & QUIET OPERATION: With 3 press buttons and LED display indicator, it is very easy to operate, assemble and remove the juicing bowl in minutes. Plus the drip-free design, you can mix different juices and prevent juices spilling out. The motor runs quietly – less than 60 decibels. Heavy-duty and stable body that let you enjoying a quiet environment and healthy life when making juice. Please touch the electric part of the juicer with the dry hand to ensure the safety operation. ✔🍉SAFE & EASY TO CLEAN: This juicer uses the safety system, it will not operate unless the juicer cover is in place. So please see the assembly steps before your first time usage. All parts are made of high quality TRITAN food grade anti-oxidation materials(BPA-free). We suggest use the REVERSE FUNCTION after juicing to avoid stuck and helps you to disassemble and clean. All detachable parts are easy cleaning with a bonus brush or can be safely cleaned in your dishwasher. ✔🍏 PREMIUM SERVICE: For Amazon customers, this product comes with Lifelong Technical Support & 24 Hours PREMIUM SERVICE. If you have any issues about the juicer, please contact us first, we will give you the satisfied solution as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LhJWdmzwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AAOBOSI","source_asin":"B07PWZ46KP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742524","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PWZ46KP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PWZ46KP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
