window.products.push({"id":742600,"name":"Trina Turk Melamine Set of 4 Bowls-Unbreakable, Lightweight Indoor & Outdoor Dinnerware Set for Home Entertaining, Barbecues, Picnics, Parties & Campi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yDPSy7ctL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Built to last. Styled for life. This season, bring understated elegance to your outdoor entertaining with the Spring Home & Lifestyle Collection from famed California designer Trina Turk. This swanky lineup of modern essentials includes a diverse selection of coordinating glassware, dishware, serving trays, beverage dispensers and beyond. Hostesses shine and guests flatter as the charming collection captures an ideal mix of personality and practicality, durability and dazzle. From intimate soirees on the veranda to enchanting dinner parties on the patio, Trina Turk’s signature optimism sets the perfect tone. Just relax, unwind, and indulge. Choose from bright, bold prints with unexpected pops of color to subtle stylings that exude positivity without pretense. There’s a piece for every occasion. Whether you’re hosting a dinner party or glamping in the wilderness, enchanting hues and graceful patterns accent the beauty of tasteful composition. With the trappings of mid-century modern design and classic American sensibility, your guests enjoy a delightful outdoor experience—no stress or hassle in sight. Start growing your Trina Turk Spring Home & Lifestyle Collection today!Specifications & details:Material: MelamineSize: 7 Inch diameterShape: RoundQuantity: 4 Piece setPattern: Basket WeaveColor: Aqua BlueCare: Hand wash only","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yDPSy7ctL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trina Turk","source_asin":"B09174ZGRF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742600","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09174ZGRF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09174ZGRF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":742601,"name":"Molgree Glass Teapot Stovetop Safe, 43oz Glass Teapot with Infuser, Glass Tea Kettle Glass Tea Pots with Removable Stainless Steel Infuser for Bloomin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LFilYDTHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DURABLE GLASS TEAPOT - Glass teapot with infuser is made of thick heatproof borosilicate glass, specially designed with non dripping spout and wide ergonomic handle, you can get every last drop into your mug without dripping. With this premium borosilicate glass tea pot all you taste is pure, delicious tea. STOVETOP SAFE GLASS TEAPOT - Glass tea kettle is stovetop safe, microwave safe and dishwasher safe, instant temperature change from -4℉ to 266℉. The teapot with infuser can also be used on electric stove tops. When you use the glass teapot in microwave oven, please take out the metal part for safety. REMOVABLE INFUSER - The removable stainless steel infuser will never rust, corrode, or discolor, fine mesh infuser can filter most of the tea leaves, even those ultra-fine particles, no need to worry about sediment floating around. The lid fits the tea infuser both when inserted or removed, it's convenient for our daily use. SUITABLE CAPACITY & GIFT PACKAGE - The clear glass teapot is 43oz / 1300ml, and brews 4-5 cups for sharing with others. The tea pots for loose tea are perfect for making all kinds of tea, drinks or even coffee. Teapot glass is well protected with PE foam, no need to worry about getting a bunch of broken glass, a perfect gift for a special person - or yourself! RISK FREE PURCHASE - Glass teapots have been optimized to be more thicker, we are confident with our premium glass teapot stovetop safe, However, if at any point you are not happy with our glass tea pots, contact us directly so that we can make it right - new replacement or refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LFilYDTHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Molgree","source_asin":"B09YYMWFFS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742601","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YYMWFFS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YYMWFFS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
