window.products.push({"id":742614,"name":"6 Slots Bamboo Wall mountable Ziplock Bag Storage Organizer and Foil & Plastic Wrap Dispenser with Cutter, for Kitchen Drawer, Counter Top, Pantry, Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AVnfP00bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"𝐎𝐑𝐆𝐀𝐍𝐈𝐙𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍 - In your kitchen, it is important to have an organized, clean space. A great way to achieve this is by using simple space-saving kitchen tools. With so many different food preparation items it can get a bit much with storage. By utilizing the Miovuec ziplock bag storage organizer organize your foil, cling film/glad wrap, sandwich bags, and Ziplock bags. Enjoy one dispenser that can be drawer and wall-mounted. 𝐂𝐎𝐍𝐕𝐄𝐍𝐈𝐄𝐍𝐂𝐄- It can get a bit annoying when you hear repeatedly from the kitchen \"where's the sandwich bags?\" With you ending up in the kitchen or pantry getting the item yourself. The Mivouec ziplock bag organizer for drawer was built to store all your kitchen essentials in one place. No more searching needed! 𝐂𝐎𝐍𝐒𝐓𝐑𝐔𝐂𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍- The ziplock bag organizer for pantry is made entirely with 1/4\" thick premium Moso bamboo. It is strong, durable, long-lasting, has extra space and depth, and uses a sustainable material. We use this premium Moso bamboo to ensure quality and perform in even the most temperate climates. Place the bag storage organizer in a kitchen drawer or hang it on the wall. The design is built so that all main brand-leading storage bags fit in our organizer. 𝐂𝐎𝐌𝐏𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐁𝐈𝐋𝐈𝐓𝐘- Use the leading kitchen storage and preparation bags with Mivouec's bamboo ziplock bag organizer. Fill the bag storage organizer with Ziploc, Solimo, Glad, Hefty for Sandwich, kitchen foil, and more. 𝐑𝐄𝐅𝐈𝐋𝐋 - To refill we made the design super simple. Once a roll of glad wrap or a bunch of sandwich bags has run out. Slide the empty roll out of the storage container and refill. The organizer ports ensure that even when hung on the wall the bags won't fall out. With each Miouvec bamboo bag storage organizer you get a 2-year warranty. Contact our friendly team for more information.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AVnfP00bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Miovuec","source_asin":"B0BHY3FKQ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742614","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHY3FKQ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHY3FKQ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
