window.products.push({"id":742644,"name":"Kleynhuis Greek Yogurt Strainer Set: Stainless Steel Colander with Organic Cotton Strainer Pouch | Premium Greek Yogurt Maker, Large 5-Quart Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x8KrpkOLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5 QUART PREMIUM QUALITY 304 stainless steel colander with silicone coated handles, bundled with the innovative Kleynhuis Greek Yogurt Strainer Pouch, make this strainer set both versatile and stylish. This Kleynhuis set can strain it all: fruit, pasta, salad greens, vegetables, yogurt, cheese, juice, nut milk, and much more. THE STURDY & STYLISH COLANDER measures 9.5 inches in diameter (inside) / 6.5” tall and has a mirror polished exterior with a brushed steel interior finish. Additional colander features: solid .6mm body thickness, horizontally bolted handles won’t interfere when placing inside a larger bowl for straining, contemporary Dutch orange silicone handles for extra grip. THE THOUGHTFULLY DESIGNED KLEYNHUIS POUCH (16”X9”) perfectly lines the interior of the colander, transforming it into an ultra-fine straining sieve, perfect for straining yogurt, cheese, and other fine foods and beverages. Additional pouch features: handy cord lock, organic cotton (GTS Certified), all seams sewn to the outside for easy cleaning, over-locked and double seams for durability, zip-shut storage bag. NO PLASTIC TOUCHES YOUR FOOD whether you are straining veggies/fruit/pasta in the stainless steel colander or straining your freshly made yogurt with the organic cotton pouch cinched around its rim. Are you considering purchasing or currently using a colander or yogurt strainer that is primarily plastic? The Kleynhuis Colander + Greek Yogurt Strainer Pouch Set is your better solution! SIMPLE STORAGE - Kleynhuis products are thoughtfully designed to be worthy of your limited storage space and valuable time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x8KrpkOLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kleynhuis","source_asin":"B07XZP1LHH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XZP1LHH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XZP1LHH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":742645,"name":"Fair Trade Ghana Bolga African Mini Market Basket 8-10\" Across X 4-5\" Tall (plus handle), GB06.60896","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EV8bPCf-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"You will receive a basket of nearly indentical colors to the one pictured above, but please keep in mind every basket is uniquely handwoven and differs slightly in design. Created in the Bolgatanga region of Ghana, these baskets are traditionally used for carrying goods to and from the market. These smaller market baskets are perfect for children, or for organizing. Weavers in the region use the abundant Veta vera grass to weave these incredibly hardy, useful baskets. Please note that if a color in the basket's pattern looks black on your screen, it is actually a very, very dark blue. Although we attempt to ship all baskets fully shaped, some baskets may need a little bit of shaping when they arrive to you. Easily reshape your basket by quickly submerging it in water and reshaping it by hand, then hanging it to dry. Make sure it is completely dry before placing it on a solid surface.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EV8bPCf-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baskets of Africa","source_asin":"B07Z6NXVH3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z6NXVH3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z6NXVH3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
