window.products.push({"id":742679,"name":"ScentSationals Perfectly Pine Scented Wax Cubes - 4-Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IltNSsiyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ScentSationals 2.5 oz Perfectly Pine Wax is a blend of fresh pine combined with eucalyptus lightly sweetened with raspberry. ScentSationals 2.5 oz Perfectly Pine Scented Wax Melts will fill your home with a rich and soothing aroma as soon as they begin to melt. Combine your favorite Scentsationals wax melt fragrances to create custom blends. Wax Melts are for use in an electric wax warmer and release a soothing highly fragrant scent into the air immediately upon melting. They are ideal for spreading a relaxing scent and welcoming atmosphere throughout your home. Simply break off a piece and add it to your favorite electric wax warmer. (Wax Warmer Sold Separately)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IltNSsiyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scentsationals","source_asin":"B01N34SVI9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N34SVI9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N34SVI9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":742680,"name":"King Mattress Jingxun 10 inch Innerspring Mattress Strong Support Pocket Spring Hybrid Mattress Pressure Relief Bed in a Box Medium Firm King Bed Matt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+PS3llNRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The cover is made of high-quality and durable knitted fabric, which is friendly to the skin and has a pleasant surface. The soft fabric and soft sponge are stitched together to closely fit your body. It is very ergonomically designed to make the body more comfortable. The inside of the spring mattress is composed of isolated pocket springs to prevent the spring from aging and prolong the life of the spring. The independent pocket spring mattress makes the body's force more balanced, can relieve the pressure on the body, and bring you a good night’s sleep. The mattresses are certified to meet the highest standards in the United States, safe, non-toxic, free of harmful chemicals, and easy to decompose which is environmentally friendly. We put the mattress in a box. After receiving the mattress, you can open the package at any time and wait for it to expand, and then fall asleep. Sometimes it takes 79 hours to rebound to its original shape. Spring mattresses are certified by CertiPUR-US and Oeko-Tex Standard 100 without harmful substances like formaldehyde, mercury, and other heavy metals, ensuring a no concern sleep","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+PS3llNRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jingxun","source_asin":"B08PKD2PYP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742680","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PKD2PYP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PKD2PYP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":742681,"name":"10000 mAh 8.5 Inch Clip-on Fan, Rechargeable Battery Operated Portable Fan with 4 Speeds, Quiet, USB Camping Fan with Hook, for Golf Cart, Treadmill, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XvqVrzRpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【8.5’’ Clip-on &Desk&Hanging Fan】With its big blades, the table fan cool better by circulating more airflow into the room. Powered by 4 energy-efficient speeds, this 7-blade high performance floor fan moves a lot of air, even on the lowest setting. You can feel the power 25 ft away after test. What’s more, this tent fan has a hanging hook and hole at the bottom, you can hang it anywhere you want to, on the tent, wall, table and so on. 【10000 mAh Battery with NTC Protection】With rechargeable 10000mAh battery (BUILT-IN), It can last for 3.5-39 hours after being fully charged.With NTC (Negative Temperature Coefficient) protection, you can use it safely without any worrying as most fans are not equipped with. Besides, the newest polymer battery has overcharge and over discharge, over temperature protection and short-circuit protection function. It supports use during charging. 【4 Speeds Tent Fan with Fast Charging】 High quality brushless motor, max wind speed 10.5ft/s, high speed and lower noise (≤40dB), adjustable 4 speeds to meet all daily needs.Support 2A fast charging, use included USB cable to fully charge the fan within 7-8 hours.. Refuel the battery by power bank or wall charger, never worry about power off and stuck in hot environment. 【Strong Clamp with 360°Rotation】With a strong 2.8 inch clamp that allows them to attach to unusual places, such as the edge of a desk, the frame of a treadmill or even a nightstand for those who tend to get overheated. Besides,the clip fan has a nimble head that can rotate 360 degrees vertically and horizontally. 【Patented JIWAN Motor with 12 Months Warranty】By many years research and development, our company designed JIWAN motor to ensure high airflow while quiet in the same time. The USB desk fan is backed with one year warranty, any suggestion or complaint during uses,just contact us directly for solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XvqVrzRpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comoistar","source_asin":"B0C2V6TNFH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742681","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2V6TNFH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2V6TNFH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
