window.products.push({"id":742746,"name":"ArtSocket 4 Pcs Shower Curtain Set Beige Grey Red Abstract Pink Painting with Non-Slip Rugs Toilet Lid Cover and Bath Mat Bathroom Decor Set 72\" x 72\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813S4o7e3VS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Premium Bathroom Accessories]: Our shower curtain is made of high-quality polyester fabric, ensuring excellent waterproof performance. The anti-slip bathroom rugs and mats set feature soft, comfortable polyurethane memory foam filling, and a cozy coral velvet microfiber outer material that's skin-friendly, relieving pressure and fatigue on your feet. The non-slip shower carpets and bath rugs are equipped with PVC dots on the bottom to prevent shifting and skidding, ensuring your safety. [The Shower Curtain Set Includes]: The waterproof shower curtain measures 72\"L x 72\"W, while the plush bathroom mat is 23.6\"L x 15.7\"W. The set also includes an o-toilet cover (16.5\"L x 14.6\"W) and a U-shaped rug (17.7\"L x 15.8\"W), all designed to fit most standard-sized bathrooms. [Effortless Installation]: Our bathroom set comes with 12 complimentary, sturdy hooks, making installation a breeze. The shower curtain features 12 reinforced grommets for easy hanging, while the non-slip bath mat and toilet lid cover ensure safety and comfort. [Elevate Your Bathroom Decor]: Thanks to the yellow abstract stylish shower curtain by ArtSocket you can create a relaxing & harmonious bathing atmosphere, while also adding an eye-catching decor piece to your bathroom interior. This stylish 4-piece bathroom set is perfect for your home, motel, hotel, or dormitory.Happy bath times ahead! [Absolutely Easy Care]: For all-time relaxing moments at home! Fully unwind during a lovely bath or shower and enjoy your peace of mind knowing that the Bathroom Sets with Shower Curtain and Rugs are conveniently machine washable in cold water - time-saving and hassle-free, what’s not to love?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813S4o7e3VS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtSocket","source_asin":"B0C4TDQCZR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742746","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4TDQCZR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4TDQCZR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
