window.products.push({"id":742770,"name":"Gooseneck Pour Over Coffee Maker And Brewer With Stand And Stainless Steel Scooper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MzxScNSvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Gooseneck pour over coffee brewer will brew coffee you wouldn't believe! Tired of poor tasting bitter coffee? Fed up with constantly having to buy paper filters? Get the cleanest and most full flavored cup of coffee you have ever tasted right at home. Regular automatic drip coffee makers don't give you any control of the process making over extracted and low temperature bitter coffee. The New York Times, writer Oliver Strand mentioned that pour-over coffee is \"so clean, so round and fruity, that you can fully taste all those complex layers of flavor that are supposed to be lurking in the best single-origin and micro-lot beans.\" With our permanent coffee filter you get to control how hot the water is, how slow or fast you want the water to be poured, and how evenly over the coffee grinds. Having control over these simple variables make a cup that tastes twice as good and for fraction of a cost of a normal coffee maker. Our ultra fine mesh is designed to make sure you get the perfect extraction every time! You will also never have to buy another paper filter ever again.As soon as you purchase our coffee pour over, we will provide detailed directions used by the best coffee shops in America to make sure you get the perfect cup each time.Easy to wash as well as dishwasher safe! We also provide a lifetime warranty so if you have any problems, we will replace your pour over brewer free of charge! We take all the purchasing decision risks for you! *Buy today and we will include a beautiful stainless steel scooper! This is for a limited time so click the \"Add to Cart\" now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MzxScNSvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gooseneck","source_asin":"B01A7EJGA8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742770","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01A7EJGA8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01A7EJGA8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
