window.products.push({"id":742797,"name":"Smart Flask 32oz Stainless Steel, Wide Mouth, Insulated Water Bottle with Solid, Hard, one Piece Biteproof Straw Lid (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41uIRqMf8LL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"At last, a vacuum insulated stainless steel water bottle that's easy to carry and keeps drinks warm or cold for up to 24 hours. Even better, the wide flip-top lid allows one-hand access. Heading to the office for an early morning? Hitting the gym for an afternoon workout? No matter what's going on in your life, your new stainless steel Smart Flask is the perfect companion. The double-wall, vacuum-insulated design not only keeps your water, iced tea, or lemonade cool and refreshing all day long, but it also keeps coffee and tea hot for up to 6 hours. No more keeping track of and cleaning multiple bottles for different drinks. All Smart Flask bottles are made with top-quality, food-grade, 18/8 stainless steel. Because you can use it for a lifetime it's better for the environment. No more Plastic in our oceans. Please! The metal cap won't crack or warp so there's never a worry about leaks, while the plastic lid offers easy one-handed accessibility. Plus, the wide opening comfortably accommodates ice cubes and even fruit, and makes for fast and easy cleaning, too. 32-ounce Stainless steel, double-wall construction Biteproof Straw Lid Vacuum insulated Leakproof Travel lid with tether Eco friendly Leakproof No sweat The genesis for the Smart Flask was in the desert outside Phoenix Arizona. It’s here that we discovered the advantages of vacuum insulation and it is here in the blistering heat that we test, use and develop the Smart Flask and the products that are to follow. Click \"Add to Cart\" to order your Smart Flask today, and pick one up for a friend, too. They make a great gift!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41uIRqMf8LL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smart Flask","source_asin":"B07XLPDWC5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XLPDWC5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XLPDWC5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
