window.products.push({"id":742836,"name":"Tiptiper Vanity Mirror with Lights and Table Set, Makeup Vanity with 3 Color Lighting Modes & Touch Screen, Vanity Desk with Nightstand and Open Shelv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BbK3kSvWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3 Colors of LED Lights & Brightness Adjustable】The mirror of this elegant vanity set is equipped with a built-in LED light bar, which is safer than the ordinary bulb design. And there are 3 light modes for you to choose: cool white light, warm white light, warm yellow light, you just need to touch the touch switch on the mirror to switch the light mode, long press the touch switch to adjust the light brightness of each mode. Meet your needs for different scenes and makeup. 【Intelligent Touch Button】Our vanity mirror is equipped with a high-sensitivity smart sensor switch to control the LED lights, which is safer and more convenient than other traditional external switches. You can turn the light on or off or switch the color of the light with a simple touch of the switch, and adjust the brightness of each lighting mode with a long press. 【Movable Nightstand Design】This lighted makeup table comes with a nightstand that can be moved from side to side so that you can freely adjust the position of the nightstand according to the distance between the bed and the wall. This great design saves you money and saves space by eliminating the need to purchase additional nightstand. 【Multiple Storage Space】This modern vanity table comes with 5 large drawers for your larger cosmetics, hair dryer, curling iron or books. Storage shelves under the mirror and on the side allow you to keep cosmetics or other beauty products within easy reach, while small drawer on the tabletop can store your jewelry, hair accessories and other small items. The powerful storage function makes your cosmetics look neat and organized. 【Height Adjustable Mirror】The mirror of vanity desk has three adjustable heights: 20.5 inches, 19.3 inches, and 18.1 inches (the distance from the highest point of the mirror to the shelf below), which can satisfy people of different heights, so please choose the most comfortable mirror height according to your needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BbK3kSvWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiptiper","source_asin":"B09WY93R53","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742836","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WY93R53","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WY93R53","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
