window.products.push({"id":742887,"name":"Yokaro Coccyx Orthopedic Seat Cushion, Office Chair and Car Seat Cushion for Back Pain and Sciatica Relief, Washable Cover (Gray)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZjTpxCSRL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Yokaro Coccyx Seat Cushion provides more comfort for people suffering from back Pain & sciatica, It helps relieve most back pain by reducing pressure on the tailbone with its cut-out rear. The ergonomic contour design further promotes proper spinal alignment and a healthy posture. The arcuate design of the legs can reduce the pain in the legs after sedentary. Portable Built-in handle makes it easy to bring comfort where ever you go and turn any hard surface into a premium seat: Office chair Car seat Wheelchair Travel, Long commutes Seated Job, Road trips, Long flights Trucks & RVs Kitchen seats Recliners Sports Bleachers, Movie Theaters Classrooms Church, Meditation and more! Washable and Anti-slip Zippered cover is soft and machine washable for easy cleaning. Non-Slip rubber bottom keeps the pillow stable, provides extra buckle strap keep the pillow stable on your office chair or car seat. Important information: Firmness for all memory foam products changes with temperature. Your cushion will feel softer in warm and firmer in cold temperatures. Room temperature is ideal for optimal performance. Yokaro Coccyx Cushion will provide less support with increasing weight. Recommended for people weighing less than 300 pounds. Size: 17.71 x 13.77 x 2.75 inches Other advice 1.Do not use in the vicinity of or in contact with fire sources/hot surfaces, such as fire, burning cigarettes or hot lamps.  2. Avoid damaging the hygiene cover when using sharp objects. 3. Extended periods of sitting increases the risk of DVT (deep‐vein thrombosis). 4. The seat cushion is primarily intended for use on a flat seat. If it is to be used in the car, we recommend adjusting the height of car seat according to your tall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZjTpxCSRL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YOKARO","source_asin":"B07916VTVJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742887","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07916VTVJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07916VTVJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":742888,"name":"It's a Wonderful Life Artwork by Vintage Apple Collection, 35 by 47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":104.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-o-re1T-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This gallery-wrapped art piece features a man and a woman in a vintage poster for the movie Its a Wonderful Life. These posters got their start in the late 1800s when brands hired artists and illustrators to create their ads and announcements for various products such as chocolates, alcohol, soap, or cigarettes. This was the time when the development of mass printing emerged and this new technology allowed for low-cost reproductions with vibrant colors. These works on posters became more affordable than original art and grew in popularity. This new industry attracted many aspiring artists looking to generate revenue from their work. The commercial success of these posters began the trend of the vintage poster, which has continued into the 21st century. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-o-re1T-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00G6E1DU0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-742888","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G6E1DU0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G6E1DU0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
